{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16156","headline":"寄贾岛 · 王建","name":"寄贾岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽日吟诗坐忍饥，万人中觅似君稀。\n僮眠冷榻朝犹卧，驴放秋田夜不归。\n傍暖旋收红落叶，觉寒犹着旧生衣。\n曲江池畔时时到，爲爱鸬鷀雨後飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}